# Stage A protocol C header entry (the C ABI revision constant).
# Run from the worktree root:
#   nix develop -c bash -c 'haxe engine-haxe/targets/protocol-c.hxml'
# The haxe bundle target compiles through stock Haxe (no reflaxe); the
# driver's gen step runs this hxml, and the emitted js is run with bun from
# the worktree root to write the generated header beside itself.
-main org.tiqian.protocol.CHeader
-js engine-haxe/out/protocol-c/gen/c-header.js
